/ Field of a text setting with the toolbar of the text formatting, in a
/ settings form built from the declared settings. Its class lets the form
/ use the full width the toolbar needs
= additionals_settings_textarea setting[:key],
                                value:,
                                tag_name:,
                                label: setting[:label],
                                required: setting[:required],
                                class: 'wiki-edit settings-wiki-text'
= wikitoolbar_for sanitize_to_id(tag_name)
